title: SMSEagle Environment Sensor
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/smseagle
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors optional temperature and humidity sensors attached to an SMSEagle
 SMS gateway. One service is created per sensor that returns a value other
 than "-1".

 Possible sensor items:

 {Temp}     — combined/default temperature reading (°C)
 {Temp1-4}  — individual temperature sensors 1 to 4 (°C)
 {Humidity} — relative humidity (%)

 The check state is always {OK}; the sensor values are stored as performance
 data so they can be graphed and used with threshold-based alert rules.

 The plugin reads extended properties via NET-SNMP EXTEND-MIB
 (.1.3.6.1.4.1.8072.1.3.2.3.1.2).

item:
 The sensor name as reported by the device: "Temp", "Temp1" … "Temp4",
 or "Humidity".

inventory:
 One service per sensor whose value is not "-1".
